-# Capture Exclusion Demo
+# 原生悬浮显示接入修订
 
-A minimal native macOS floating panel that shows the latest AI answer while
-asking WindowServer to omit it from supported screen-capture pipelines.
+原生窗口、字体/颜色设置、翻页、移动等既有交互保留。新增菜单手动截图、可配置状态目录、版本化状态读取、显示回执和失联提示。不使用 Tk。
 
-## Run
+在 macOS 编译：`sh build.sh`。编译成功前不删除旧应用，替换时保留时间戳备份。该修订包在 Linux 完成 Python/接口测试，不能据此宣称 Swift/AppKit 已编译或在牛客验证。
 
-```bash
-./run.sh
-```
+应用通过 `--lanshot-display-dir /绝对路径` 读取新目录中的 `latest_state.json` 和 `page.txt`，写入 `display_ack.json` 和 `overlay_status.json`。无此参数时保留旧目录读取兼容，但不能宣称版本回执已接入。
 
-The panel stays above normal windows, follows all Spaces, does not appear in the
-Dock, and can be dragged. Right-click anywhere in the transparent panel to open
-settings. Settings are applied live and saved automatically.
-
-The settings panel controls the window width and height, font size, text color,
-and opacity. It also includes the saved Configuration A preset. Capture
-exclusion is always on and cannot be disabled from settings.
-
-The panel watches `~/.local/share/lanshot-receiver/latest.txt` and refreshes
-automatically when the receiver writes a new answer. The receiver uses an
-atomic file replacement, so the panel never reads a half-written answer.
-Pressing `F22` writes a page command through the sender and scrolls the answer
-down by one page. Pressing it on the last page returns to the beginning.
-
-Moving the pointer into the transparent panel raises visible content to at least
-15% opacity. Moving it away restores the saved opacity.
-
-## Test
-
-1. Confirm that the panel is visible near the top of the local display.
-2. Take a macOS screenshot or start a meeting screen share.
-3. Inspect the captured output from another device or participant view.
-
-The relevant native setting is:
-
-```swift
-window.sharingType = .none
-```
-
-This is best-effort capture exclusion, not an absolute security boundary. A
-capture tool may ignore the setting, and a camera or hardware capture device
-will still see the physical display.
+原源码中的窗口共享属性没有新增或加强；它们不构成免于系统/第三方采集的保证。此次没有实现或验证规避平台检测的能力。
